{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29242","headline":"奉和卢大夫新立假山 · 许浑","name":"奉和卢大夫新立假山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岩谷留心赏，爲山极自然。\n孤峰空迸笋，攒萼旋开莲。\n黛色朱楼下，云形绣户前。\n砌尘凝积霭，檐溜挂飞泉。\n树暗壶中月，花香洞里天。\n何如谢康乐，海峤独题篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29242.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29242","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}